      step('trail','ward','Return the used pots on a separate path','Check the ward collection tray, conduit return shelf, and runner platform.',line('Nim','Clean pots go in. Used pots come back by the labelled shelf. The next carrier can tell them apart.'),{targets:[target('ward','Collect the used pot count','Nim','Both quiet trays are back with their lids.'),target('conduit','Check the used-pot shelf','Nim','This shelf is marked for washing. It holds no fresh meal.'),target('entry','Confirm the kitchen return','Nim','Nara receives the empty count before the next cooking batch.')]}),
      step('talk','hospital','Close the first shared kitchen round','Review the receiving and return counts. Give Nim time to eat.',[say('Nim','The counter kept the late sitting. The ward volunteer returned both trays. The plan worked beyond its first table.','living_table_counter'),say('Nim','The cart served the night posts and came back with its pot count. The route worked beyond its first round.','living_table_cart'),say('iona','Six meals, six people, and no extra bell. Sit down, Nim.')],{evidence:evidence('The complete kitchen round','The quay, mill, market, and ward now share labelled food measures, meal requests, and empty-pot returns. The chosen service completed a real round.'),visual:visual('meal','A place for the last runner','The handover is complete. Nim has a covered meal and a chair after the last bell.')})
